      <h2>Payments and Billing</h2>

      <h3>Payment Processing</h3>
      <p>All payments for subscriptions, extra storage, and token purchases are processed through Google Play Billing. By making a purchase you agree to Google Play's terms of service in addition to these terms. We never directly handle, store, or have access to your payment card information.</p>

      <h3>Subscription Billing</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Subscriptions are billed in advance on a monthly or yearly basis depending on the plan you choose</li>
        <li>Your subscription automatically renews at the end of each billing period unless you cancel before the renewal date</li>
        <li>Renewal charges are processed through Google Play at the price current at the time of renewal</li>
        <li>You will be notified of any price changes before they take effect</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Token Purchases</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Tokens are purchased through Google Play Billing and credited to your account immediately after successful payment</li>
        <li>Tokens have no cash value and cannot be exchanged for real money</li>
        <li>Tokens do not expire as long as your account remains active</li>
        <li>Tokens are non-transferable between accounts</li>
        <li>Upon account deletion all unused tokens are forfeited with no refund</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Extra Storage Subscriptions</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Extra storage is billed monthly at ₹99 per 10GB through Google Play Billing</li>
        <li>Multiple extra storage subscriptions stack to provide additional storage</li>
        <li>Extra storage subscriptions renew automatically each month</li>
        <li>If an extra storage subscription is cancelled storage is maintained until the end of the current billing period</li>
        <li>After cancellation if stored content exceeds the remaining storage limit new uploads will be blocked but existing content will not be deleted</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Failed Payments</h3>
      <p>If a payment fails Google Play will attempt to retry the payment automatically. During the retry period your subscription remains active. If payment ultimately fails your subscription will be downgraded or cancelled and you will be notified to update your payment method through Google Play.</p>
    </div>

